{"page":211,"verses":[{"verse_key":"10:21","surah":10,"ayah":21,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَآ أَذَقْنَا ٱلنَّاسَ رَحْمَةً مِّنۢ بَعْدِ ضَرَّآءَ مَسَّتْهُمْ إِذَا لَهُم مَّكْرٌ فِىٓ ءَايَاتِنَا ۚ قُلِ ٱللَّهُ أَسْرَعُ مَكْرًا ۚ إِنَّ رُسُلَنَا يَكْتُبُونَ مَا تَمْكُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"No sooner do We let people taste some mercy after some hardship has afflicted them, than they begin to scheme against Our revelations. Say, ‘God schemes even faster.’ Our messengersrecord all your scheming.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَآ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"10:21"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَذَقْنَا","en_gloss":"We let [the] mankind taste","transliteration":"adhaqnā","verse_key":"10:21"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسَ","en_gloss":"We let [the] mankind taste","transliteration":"l-nāsa","verse_key":"10:21"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَحْمَةًۭ","en_gloss":"mercy","transliteration":"raḥmatan","verse_key":"10:21"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّنۢ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"10:21"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"10:21"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ضَرَّآءَ","en_gloss":"adversity","transliteration":"ḍarrāa","verse_key":"10:21"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَسَّتْهُمْ","en_gloss":"has touched them","transliteration":"massathum","verse_key":"10:21"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"behold","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"10:21"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"They have","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"10:21"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَّكْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"a plot","transliteration":"makrun","verse_key":"10:21"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"against","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"10:21"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ءَايَاتِنَا ۚ","en_gloss":"Our Verses","transliteration":"āyātinā","verse_key":"10:21"},{"pos":14,"ar":"قُلِ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"quli","verse_key":"10:21"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"10:21"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَسْرَعُ","en_gloss":"(is) mo